    turnFlow: "1. Deal: Each player and the dealer receives seven cards. 2. Split: Players divide cards into a 5-card back hand and a 2-card front hand. 3. Constraint: The 5-card hand must always outrank the 2-card hand. 4. Reveal: Hands are compared against the banker's hands. 5. Scoring: Win both to win; lose both to lose; split one each for a push. Ties favor the banker.",
